y/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/superbobry","id":185856,"login":"superbobry","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTg1Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/superbobry","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"### Description\n\nI updated JAX and am getting inputs to callback functions coming in as `jax.ArrayImpl` and not `np.ndarray`.\r\n\r\n```python\r\nimport jax\r\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\r\nimport numpy as np\r\n\r\n\r\ndef fn(x: jax.Array) -> jax.Array:\r\n    # Define the expected shape & dtype of output.\r\n    result_shape_dtype = jax.ShapeDtypeStruct(\r\n        shape=np.shape(x),\r\n        dtype=x.dtype\r\n    )\r\n\r\n    return jax.pure_callback(_host_fn, result_shape_dtype, x)\r\n\r\n\r\ndef _host_fn(x: np.ndarray):\r\n    print('x', type(x))\r\n    assert isinstance(x, np.ndarray)\r\n    return x\r\n\r\n\r\nif __name__ == '__main__':\r\n    fn(jnp.asarray([1.]))\r\n```\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\r\njax==0.4.28\r\njaxlib==0.4.28\r\n```","closed_at":"2024-05-30T19:38:12Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gist